   "type": "definition",
   "name": "Coefficients b', v', h' and gamma terms",
   "statement": "Similarly fix $(b'_i)_{i = l}^{n - l - 1}$, $(v'_i)_{i = l}^{n - l - 1}$ and $(h'_i)_{i = l}^{n - l - 1} \\in F^{n-l}$, and $b_\\gamma, v_\\gamma, h_\\gamma, b_{\\gamma\\beta}, v_{\\gamma\\beta}$.",
   "section": "2 Knowledge Soundness for BabySNARK",
   "origin": "paper",
   "confidence": 0.85,
   "definiendum": [
    "$(b'_i)_{i = l}^{n - l - 1}$",
    "$(v'_i)_{i = l}^{n - l - 1}$",
    "$(h'_i)_{i = l}^{n - l - 1}$",
